# kind | name | source (on-disk LICENSE path for shards; for clib/runtime, an
# SPDX id of licenses-spdx/, or the path of the library's own license file)
#
# Only what the released binary actually embeds: the runtime shards of
# shard.yml (none pulls a shard of its own; see shard.lock), and the C
# libraries the stdlib modules squarectl requires link. Add a line for every
# runtime shard added.
#
# CONFIRMED on 2026-11-18 against the link line of this very binary, in
# alpine:3.24 with Alpine's crystal 1.20.3 (the base of the Dockerfile and of
# the image crystalreleaser generates for the linux builds):
#   -lxml2 -lm -lz -llzma -lyaml -lpcre2-8 -pthread -lgc -ldl  (+ musl, libgcc)
# No OpenSSL: nothing squarectl requires reaches TLS. libxml2 and liblzma come
# from crinja's XML support, libyaml from the YAML config. Versions and
# licenses as apk records them in that image: libxml2 2.13.9 MIT, xz-libs
# 5.8.4 (liblzma alone is 0BSD; the GPL parts of xz are the command-line
# tools), yaml 0.2.5 MIT, pcre2 10.49 BSD-3-Clause, zlib 1.4 Zlib, musl 1.2.6
# MIT, gc 8.2.12 Boehm-GC. The darwin binaries take these libraries from macOS
# or from the compiler mise installs. Check the link line again when a stdlib
# module is added or the image moves.
#
# MIT, BSD-3-Clause, zlib and 0BSD texts are templates whose copyright line is
# a blank: those libraries embed their own license file, taken from their
# sources at the versions above:
#   libxml2  Copyright      gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2  tag v2.13.9
#   liblzma  COPYING.0BSD   github.com/tukaani-project/xz   tag v5.8.4
#   libyaml  License        github.com/yaml/libyaml         tag 0.2.5
#   pcre2    LICENCE.md     github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2   tag pcre2-10.49
#   zlib     LICENSE        github.com/madler/zlib          tag v1.4
#   musl     COPYRIGHT      git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl     tag v1.2.6
shard   | admiral           | lib/admiral/LICENSE
shard   | baked_file_system | lib/baked_file_system/LICENSE
shard   | crinja            | lib/crinja/LICENSE
shard   | crystal-env       | lib/crystal-env/LICENSE
clib    | libxml2           | licenses-upstream/libxml2.txt
clib    | liblzma           | licenses-upstream/liblzma.txt
clib    | libyaml           | licenses-upstream/libyaml.txt
clib    | pcre2             | licenses-upstream/pcre2.txt
clib    | zlib              | licenses-upstream/zlib.txt
clib    | boehm-gc          | Boehm-GC
clib    | musl              | licenses-upstream/musl.txt
clib    | libgcc            | GCC-runtime-exception
runtime | crystal           | Apache-2.0
project | squarectl         | LICENSE
